Subject: Re: CircuitFit beta priorities - storage and privacy concerns

For the initial MVP, engineering recommends browser-local storage only.

A backend account system would add:
- identity and access management
- data retention obligations
- security review
- operational monitoring
- multi-environment deployment

We can add export/import of locally saved workouts as a bounded enhancement.
We should not add cloud profiles, social leaderboards or wearable ingestion
without an approved design revision.

